the JPA line drawer, J2DPictureEx::insertCommon, the Sato fsel/frsqrte
helpers and JPSquareDistance. J2DPictureEx::animationPane also returns
the value it computes (the decomp falls off the end, which MWCC tolerates
because r3 already holds it; clang treats it as undefined behaviour).

